supabase/snippets/
supabase/.temp/
/playwright/.auth/user.json

/test-results/
/.playwright-cli/

# The remaining Playwright artifact classes. LATENT, not observed: the default `list` reporter
# produces none of these today — they appear the moment someone adds an HTML/blob reporter or a
# screenshot assertion. Listed anyway so the first person to do so does not commit them.
#
# Root-anchored deliberately, matching the two entries above: an anchored ignore does NOT cover a
# moved `outputDir`, and that is the intended tradeoff — a relocated output directory should have
# to be ignored explicitly rather than swept up by a pattern nobody re-reads.
/playwright-report/
/blob-report/
/.last-run.json
# NOT anchored: snapshot directories are created beside the spec that owns them, wherever it sits.
*-snapshots/
